            "review_title": "Review at M House Fusion Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "Maggie\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n1\nThe BEST Frozen Cocktails in the world!\nSep 2023 • Family\nI’m a world traveler and a total Foodie, I keep finding myself returning to Vietnam every chance I get. I came by this unique looking Fusion Restaurant the M House in Thao Dien where I normally stayed and thought I needed a beer to calm this angry Saigon heat. I was immediately greeted by a smiling staff and was introduced to their popular Frozen Cocktail, I opted for the Ha Noi Pomegranate, and then the Marker’s Mark and the Double D’s and then I lost count LOL.. \n\nThis place is AMAZING… food is extraordinary, the drinks is something else. Who needs a beer when you can have all this goodness!! Their Frozen Cocktails is a must have, it’s like a mixed of icy flavors with a kick of Tequila blend to perfection, not sweet like beer nor bitter like wine, it is made for this weather. The food is like a bit and pieces here and there of the world fusion onto a plate and tastes just right! I Love the Poke Nachos. Today is my third time there and just like Vietnam, I will keep returning to this restaurant every chance I get.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 16, 2023",
