            "review_title": "Review at M House Fusion Restaurant & Bar",
            "review_text": "MickeyCung\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam212 contributions\n1\nAmazing frozen cocktails\nNov 2023 • Couples\nWe were driving around thao dien and stopped by accidentally after saw their opening promotion, we were quite surprised about the food and the drink here.\n\nHave you ever heard about frozen cocktails in Vietnam yet? Omg, they made it so good and this is the first time I try frozen cocktails. I have my own favorite alcohol and I always drink it only but I’m very happy to find my second favorite drink and I bet I can only find it here. I got 3 glasses of Paradise Patron and my boyfriend got 4 glasses of The Jungle because we couldn’t stop!\n\nWe tried Nachos with Tuna, it’s delicious and looks very nice with red color of tuna, green color of avocado, black color of seaweed,.. Also the bowl of Wonton is tasty with fresh shrimp inside.\n\nMs Tuyet is amazing! She is super nice, friendly and caring, she walked around to keep checking if everything is good for their guests. If you need anything, just look up and she is right there.\n\nI also like their decoration, it is very simple but classic. Their cactus are extremely cute!! They are in good location in Thao dien with many shopping stores around, it is very easy to find them.\n\nHighly recommend everyone should come to try this restaurant, specially their frozen cocktails.\nRead more\nWritten November 17, 2023",
